</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ec410e80-7d87-11f1-aa5e-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-12T000629Z-1152436218-UP1EM7C00ASFT-RTRMADP-3-SOCCER-WORLDCUP-NOR-ENG.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ec410e80-7d87-11f1-aa5e-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-12T000629Z-1152436218-UP1EM7C00ASFT-RTRMADP-3-SOCCER-WORLDCUP-NOR-ENG.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">f1019836-7d87-11f1-9ffd-8b851e27794f</guid><pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 00:23:42 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ec410e80-7d87-11f1-aa5e-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-12T000629Z-1152436218-UP1EM7C00ASFT-RTRMADP-3-SOCCER-WORLDCUP-NOR-ENG.jpg">REUTERS - Paul Childs</source><dc:creator>安德烈</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>大热门撞上大热门 法国如何跨越西班牙大关</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260711-%E5%A4%A7%E7%83%AD%E9%97%A8%E6%92%9E%E4%B8%8A%E5%A4%A7%E7%83%AD%E9%97%A8-%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E8%B7%A8%E8%B6%8A%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99%E5%A4%A7%E5%85%B3</link><description>
